---
title: "split (Sui Framework: balance)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: check self.value >= value
    q_validate --> q_abort: self.value < value
    q_abort --> [*]: abort ENotEnough
    q_validate --> q_update: sufficient balance
    q_update --> q_return: self.value = self.value - value
    q_return --> [*]: return Balance(value)

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: self.value >= value (sufficient funds)
        INV-002: self.value_post + returned.value = self.value_pre (conservation)
    end note
